{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"544d744d-dac1-4f90-9726-09f7330b4e30","agentId":"a55a893f5ab38c083","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"这是一个**P0 路线图项的源码核实任务**，参考 `D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\C:\\Users\\22957\\.claude\\projects\\D--claude-pj-zmd\\memory\\feedback_verify_solver_param_claims.md` 的方法（已经救回过一个伪金矿 R5 shared_tree）。\n\n**目标项**：路线图 P0 #3 \"UNSAT subsolver portfolio +30-70%\"\n**来源 transcript**：`D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\docs\\research\\agent_transcripts\\aa32783403f3cf351.output`\n**项目背景**：CP-SAT 9.15，master 跑 8 worker，max_lex(area, min_side) 优化（不是 SAT/UNSAT 主问题）\n\n**任务（≤700 字）：**\n\n1. 先读 `aa32783403f3cf351.output`（这是 Round 2 当时的金矿调研），找出**具体推荐了哪些 CP-SAT 参数**（参数名 + 推荐值 + 应用场景）。\n2. 对每个具体参数到 OR-Tools v9.15 GitHub 仓库 `ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto` 和相关 `.cc` 文件**读源码核实**：\n   - 该参数当前默认值\n   - 该参数在 max problem（has_objective）vs UNSAT proof 模式下的行为差异\n   - 是否和其他 worker 资源竞争（像 shared_tree 那样从 num_workers 扣）\n   - 是否有 worker count 阈值（少 worker 时归零）\n3. **关键**：原 R2 调研引用的 \"+30-70% UNSAT\" benchmark 是 SAT/feasibility 类，**我们是 max optimization**——确认参数推荐在 max objective 下是否仍 work。\n4. 如果发现至少 1 个推荐参数在我们配置下行为反预期或负 ROI，报告 \"❌ REFUTED\" + 具体源码证据 + 推荐改成什么；如果全部 verified ok，报告 \"✅ VERIFIED\" + 各参数实际预期影响。\n\n**关键 URL**：\n- proto: https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/v9.15/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto\n- solver: https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/v9.15/ortools/sat/cp_model_solver.cc\n- helpers: https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/v9.15/ortools/sat/cp_model_solver_helpers.cc\n\n输出末尾：\"P0 #3 verdict = REFUTED / PARTIALLY_REFUTED / VERIFIED\" + 要不要保留为 P0。"},"uuid":"650642f5-f834-4490-a6f9-b343c212f673","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:53:37.414Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
