{"parentUuid":"21a0b217-dc90-462b-8b21-66ff0902c45f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"544d744d-dac1-4f90-9726-09f7330b4e30","agentId":"a55a893f5ab38c083","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0198RAHBWRAK921TEFvMAzof","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"d7fd903f-4eab-4718-8a3d-1c392317615c\",\"agentId\":\"aa32783403f3cf351\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"系统调研 OR-Tools CP-SAT 求解器除了 worker count 之外的所有重要参数及其调优。\\n\\n**背景：** 我们项目用 CP-SAT 解 70×70 网格放置问题，硬候选 4 分钟内解不出。已经在 S5/S6 阶段调过 worker count 矩阵（每进程 4-16 workers，分 master/binding/routing/flow 不同 phase）。但 CP-SAT 还有**几十个其他参数**完全没碰过——这些参数空间可能有数倍提速。\\n\\n我们当前已设的参数：\\n- num_search_workers (8)\\n- search_branching = FIXED_SEARCH\\n- symmetry_level = 3\\n- cp_model_probing_level = 3\\n- hint_conflict_limit = 1000\\n- cp_model_presolve = True\\n- max_time_in_seconds = 600\\n\\n**调研重点（用 WebSearch + WebFetch）：**\\n\\n1. **`sat_parameters.proto` 全量参数清单**：\\n   - GitHub 上读 [or-tools sat_parameters.proto](https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\\n   - 列出 30-50 个值得调的参数（不需要全部）\\n   - 每个参数：名字、默认值、调优方向、对什么类问题敏感\\n\\n2. **几个重点参数族：**\\n   - **Restart strategy**: `restart_algorithms`, `restart_period`, `restart_dl_average_ratio`, `restart_lbd_average_ratio`\\n   - **Clause learning/cleanup**: `clause_cleanup_period`, `clause_cleanup_protection`, `clause_cleanup_ordering`, `clause_cleanup_target`, `glucose_max_decay`\\n   - **Presolve**: `presolve_substitution_level`, `presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit`, `presolve_blocked_clause`, `presolve_use_bva`, `presolve_bve_threshold`, `inprocessing_dtime_ratio`\\n   - **Cuts**: `add_clique_cuts`, `add_lin_max_cuts`, `add_objective_cut`, `add_zero_half_cuts`, `add_mir_cuts`, `add_rlt_cuts`, `cut_active_count_decay`\\n   - **Search**: `search_branching` (FIXED/AUTO/PORTFOLIO/HINT_SEARCH/PARTIAL_FIXED/RANDOMIZED), `randomize_search`, `linearization_level`, `instantiate_all_variables`\\n   - **LP**: `linearization_level`, `mip_max_bound`, `use_implied_bounds`\\n   - **Optimization**: `binary_minimization_algorithm`, `polarity_xor_clause_minimization`\\n\\n3. **2024-2026 调参经验**：\\n   - CP-SAT primer 推荐\\n   - SAT/CP 社区调参文献\\n   - Google Developers OR-Tools blog 帖子\\n   - Laurent Perron 在 issue tracker 的发言\\n\\n4. **针对 long-running UNSAT 类问题的特别建议**：\\n   - 我们的硬候选大概率 INFEASIBLE，但需要长时间证明\\n   - 哪些参数对 UNSAT 证明效率影响大\\n   - LBD-based clause cleanup 对长跑的影响\\n   - inprocessing 对 UNSAT 的帮助\\n\\n5. **针对结构化几何问题的建议**：\\n   - placement / packing / routing 类问题\\n   - linearization_level 对 cumulative / no_overlap 约束的影响\\n   - cuts 对 grid 类约束的效果\\n\\n6. **Auto-tuning 工具**：\\n   - SMAC / OPATune / 其他超参 tuner\\n   - 哪些可以套 CP-SAT\\n   - 我们能不能跑一个自动调参实验\\n\\n7. **环境变量 / Python API 怎么设这些参数**：\\n   - `solver.parameters.xxx = value` 完整语法\\n   - 哪些参数只在特定 worker 类型生效\\n   - 哪些参数会跟 `num_search_workers > 1` 冲突\\n\\n**输出格式（不超过 1200 字）：**\\n- 表格：top 15 个我们没动过、但很可能有效的参数（参数名 | 当前默认 | 推荐方向 | 预计效果 | 风险）\\n- 关键链接 markdown 格式\\n- 末尾给\\\"3 个最值得立刻试的参数实验\\\"，每个能在 1 天内跑出结论\\n\\n要具体到参数名+默认值+推荐值，不要\\\"试试看搜索策略\\\"这种空话。\"},\"uuid\":\"d65b1165-02bb-4255-9542-1c0b73ec8ff3\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T20:29:17.085Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n2\t{\"parentUuid\":\"d65b1165-02bb-4255-9542-1c0b73ec8ff3\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"aa32783403f3cf351\",\"attachment\":{\"type\":\"deferred_tools_delta\",\"addedNames\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"addedLines\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"removedNames\":[],\"readdedNames\":[]},\"type\":\"attachment\",\"uuid\":\"87c17456-41e3-4d26-a80f-7485f3088