{"parentUuid":"6e6b1a32-e86a-47cf-9c51-942b0637f4c3","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a55a893f5ab38c083","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Fhyt25u5WM1ghziacavFAk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YDpMkwTqvewT8VZMp1sb9k","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/or-tools/v9.15/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto","prompt":"Find these exact parameters and quote their default values + comments verbatim:\n1. subsolvers (and ignore_subsolvers, extra_subsolvers, filter_subsolvers)\n2. linearization_level\n3. cut_level\n4. add_objective_cut\n5. cp_model_probing_level\n6. presolve_probing_deterministic_time_limit\n7. max_presolve_iterations\n8. presolve_bve_threshold\n9. inprocessing_dtime_ratio\n10. clause_cleanup_period\n11. clause_cleanup_ordering\n12. clause_cleanup_lbd_bound\n13. restart_algorithms\n14. use_phase_saving\n15. polarity_rephase_increment\n16. randomize_search\n17. repair_hint\n18. use_lb_relax_lns and lb_relax_num_workers_threshold\n19. use_objective_shaving_search\n20. share_objective_bounds\nFor each, show the proto line including default and any comment about UNSAT, infeasibility, or worker count. ALSO, list every named subsolver string mentioned in any comment block (look for the long comment that lists named subsolvers like \"default_lp\", \"no_lp\", \"max_lp\", \"core\", \"lb_tree_search\", \"probing\", \"objective_lb_search\", \"pseudo_costs\", \"reduced_costs\", \"quick_restart\")."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":26932,"cache_read_input_tokens":13113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":26932,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011Cap2m94UNyFhD4XYFHXxg","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"c06ae3a4-c656-400d-9590-048168426c